{"type": "step", "node_id": 23, "parent_node_id": 22, "role": "assistant", "content": "## Solution\n\n**Sequence:** $a_1=a_2=a_3=1$, and $a_{n+3}=a_{n+2}+a_{n+1}+a_n$.\n\n### Step 1: Derive a closed form for the partial sum\n\nLet $S_N = \\sum_{k=1}^{N} a_k$. From the recurrence,\n\n$$a_{k+3} - a_{k+2} = a_{k+1} + a_k \\implies a_k = (a_{k+3}-a_{k+2}) - a_{k+1}.$$\n\nSumming from $k=1$ to $N$:\n\n$$S_N = \\sum_{k=1}^{N}(a_{k+3}-a_{k+2}) - \\sum_{k=1}^{N} a_{k+1} = (a_{N+3}-a_3) - (S_N - a_1 + a_{N+1}).$$\n\nUsing $a_1=a_3=1$:\n\n$$S_N = a_{N+3} - 1 - S_N + 1 - a_{N+1} = a_{N+3} - a_{N+1} - S_N,$$\n\n$$\\boxed{2S_N = a_{N+3} - a_{N+1}} \\implies S_N = \\frac{a_{N+3}-a_{N+1}}{2}.$$\n\n**Verification:** $S_4 = 1+1+1+3 = 6$, and $(a_7-a_5)/2 = (17-5)/2 = 6$. ✓\n\n### Step 2: Compute $a_{31}$\n\nWith $N=28$:\n\n$$S_{28} = \\frac{a_{31}-a_{29}}{2}.$$\n\n$$a_{31} = a_{30}+a_{29}+a_{28} = 20603361 + 11201821 + 6090307 = 37895489.$$\n\n### Step 3: Compute $S_{28} \\bmod 1000$\n\n$$S_{28} = \\frac{37895489 - 11201821}{2} = \\frac{26693668}{2} = 13346834.$$\n\n$$13346834 \\bmod 1000 = \\boxed{834}.$$\n\nThe remainder when $\\sum_{k=1}^{28} a_k$ is divided by 1000 is **834**.\n\n### PROOF COMPLETE", "thinking": "Let me solve this problem. The tribonacci-like sequence with a_1=a_2=a_3=1, a_{n+3}=a_{n+2}+a_{n+1}+a_n.\n\nKey identity: Sum of tribonacci. Note that a_{n+3} = a_{n+2}+a_{n+1}+a_n, so a_n = a_{n+3} - a_{n+2} - a_{n+1}.\n\nSum from k=1 to 28 of a_k.\n\nLet me use the telescoping identity. We have a_{n+3} = a_{n+2}+a_{n+1}+a_n.\n\nSo a_n = a_{n+3} - a_{n+2} - a_{n+1}.\n\nSum_{k=1}^{N} a_k = sum of (a_{k+3} - a_{k+2} - a_{k+1}).\n\nHmm, let me think differently. Consider S_N = sum_{k=1}^{N} a_k.\n\nWe know a_{k+3} - a_{k+2} = a_{k+1} + a_k. So a_k = a_{k+3} - a_{k+2} - a_{k+1}.\n\nActually, let's find a telescoping. Sum_{k=1}^{N} a_k.\n\nNote a_{k+3} - a_{k+2} = a_{k+1} + a_k. So a_k = (a_{k+3} - a_{k+2}) - a_{k+1}.\n\nSum_{k=1}^{N} a_k = sum_{k=1}^{N} (a_{k+3} - a_{k+2}) - sum_{k=1}^{N} a_{k+1}\n= (a_{N+3} - a_3) - (sum_{k=2}^{N+1} a_k)\n= a_{N+3} - a_3 - (S_N - a_1 + a_{N+1})\n= a_{N+3} - 1 - S_N + 1 - a_{N+1}\n= a_{N+3} - a_{N+1} - S_N\n\nSo 2 S_N = a_{N+3} - a_{N+1}, thus S_N = (a_{N+3} - a_{N+1})/2.\n\nFor N=28: S_28 = (a_{31} - a_{29})/2.\n\nWe need a_{31}. a_{31} = a_{30}+a_{29}+a_{28} = 20603361 + 11201821 + 6090307 = 37895489.\n\nLet me add: 20603361 + 11201821 = 31805182. + 6090307 = 37895489.\n\nS_28 = (37895489 - 11201821)/2 = 26693668/2 = 13346834.\n\nNow mod 1000: 13346834 mod 1000 = 834.\n\nLet me verify the identity with small values. a_1=a_2=a_3=1, a_4=3, a_5=5, a_6=9, a_7=17.\n\nS_4 = 1+1+1+3 = 6. (a_7 - a_5)/2 = (17-5)/2 = 6. ✓\n\nS_5 = 6+5=11. (a_8 - a_6)/2. a_8 = a_7+a_6+a_5 = 17+9+5=31. (31-9)/2 = 11. ✓\n\nGreat. So answer is 834.\n\nLet me double check 37895489 - 11201821 = 26693668. /2 = 13346834. mod 1000 = 834.", "tool_calls": [], "created_at": 1786646393}
